// The specification of Exegra, kept as a manifest of part files, one per area (WG-5704). Resolve it with
// tools/spec-manifest.js. Do not read the parts directly: use `node cli/exegra.js get|find|refs --project exegra`.
// "specSections" says which part `apply` writes a new entity of a section to; see docs/model-and-format.md.
